<article class="env-corollary" id="B9C4E7">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/B9C4E7">Corollary <span data-tag="B9C4E7">7.3.4.10</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a locally compact topological space and $\calC $ a presentable $\infty $-category in which filtered colimits are left exact. Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[ \Shv _{{\mathcal K}{\mathcal U}}(X;\calC ) \subseteq \Fun (\Nerve (\calK (X) \cup \calU (X))^{op}, \calC ) \]
</div>
  <p> be the full subcategory spanned by those presheaves which satisfy the equivalent conditions of Theorem <a href="/tag/A9FA51" data-tag="A9FA51">7.3.4.9</a>. Then the restriction functors </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \Shv (X;\calC ) \leftarrow \Shv _{{\mathcal K}{\mathcal U}}(X;\calC ) \rightarrow \Shv _{\calK }(X;\calC ) \]
</div>
  <p>ShvcalKUX@$\Shv _{{\mathcal K}{\mathcal U}}(X;\calC )$ are equivalences of $\infty $-categories. </p>
</article>